  {
   "note": "[event:evt.gen_47.jacob_blesses_pharaoh] Jacob's age (130) falls at his arrival; anchor.jacob_birth (2006 BCE) + 130 = 1876 BCE, matching the chain from gen_46. Not anchored twice.",
