  },
  {
   "note": "[event:evt.gen_47.land_sale_second_year] Rashi takes 'the second year' as the second year of the famine; Sforno as the year after the money ran out (the seventh). I follow Sforno. Rashi's reading would put it before Jacob's arrival, which the text contradicts.",
   "produced_by": {
    "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "skill": "urim-chronologist@5",
    "run": "main"
