   "at": "2026-11-02T14:00:02+00:00"
  },
  {
   "note": "[event:evt.gen_47.cattle_for_bread] Famine-year numbering is from Sforno and the 45:6 'two years'; offsets are estimates with a one-year margin. 'Years' here are the famine years counted from the start; I assume the famine started about two years before Jacob's arrival.",
   "produced_by": {
    "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "skill": "urim-chronologist@5",
    "run": "main"
