  {
   "note": "[event:evt.gen_47.jacob_makes_joseph_swear] Joseph's promise and Jacob's wish to be buried at Machpelah will be taken up in Gen 49–50; those chapters' sessions should write the links. Also God's word in 46:4 ('Joseph shall put his hand upon thine eyes') is for ch. 50.",
